::kind(writ)

=[ Writ: rule-no-guard fixture ]

==[ crate-layering ]

@rule(crate-layering){
  layers: {
    0: list("thing")
  }
}

A rule with parameters and no `guard`. Nothing says who holds it, and the
absence is indistinguishable from an oversight -- which is why it is an
error rather than a rule counted as unguarded.
